				<region region-id="203028" left="6" top="5253" width="534" height="22.5" align-x="6" align-y="5262" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="Pedestrian modification">
					<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
						<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">With q.PL = 90 psf, W.PL = 12 ft and L = 105.7667 ft: w.PL = 0.540 kip/ft; Mmax.PL = 755.0947 kip-ft; Reaction.PL = 28.557 kip. These are unfactored checks; recomputed values follow the active input geometry.</p>
					</text>
				</region>
				<region region-id="203029" left="6" top="5313" width="534" height="22.5" align-x="6" align-y="5322" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="Pedestrian modification">
					<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
						<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">Basis: AASHTO pedestrian guide Articles 3.1 and 3.6 (load patterning, no dynamic allowance); RFQ Structures criterion 27 (L/1000). Equal transverse sharing is the stated model assumption, not a vehicular LRFD distribution factor.</p>
					</text>
				</region>
				<region region-id="151231" left="126" top="5439" width="106.5" height="45" align-x="126" align-y="5448" show-border="false" show-highlight="true" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="#f1f1f1" tag="">
					<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
						<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">P vector set contains the magnitudes of the system of concentrated loads (HS20 is default)</p>
					</text>
				</region>
				<region region-id="151230" left="372" top="5439" width="141.75" height="45" align-x="372" align-y="5448" show-border="false" show-highlight="true" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="#f1f1f1" tag="">
					<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
						<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">d vector set contains the spacings between the concentrated loads.<sp count="2"/>The first and last values are place holders and should always be zero</p>
					</text>
				</region>
