					<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
						<p style="Normal" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">Bar Size of the longitudinal mild reinforcement in the bottom end of the beam</p>
