						<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">If NoGood, check alternate bonded and debonded strand locations both horizontally and vertically </p>
					</text>
				</region>
