					<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
						<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">The concrete stresses are calculated based on the transformed section properties, the efforts of losses and gains due to elastic deformations are implicitly accounted for and <region region-id="140876" left="234" top="4101" width="21.75" height="15" align-x="243.75" align-y="4110" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
