					<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
						<p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">principal tensile stress check in the web (DC - Demand/Capacity Ratio)</p>
					</text>
